OL,3,GNEWSAWedding cake sculptural pavilion
OL,4,Ato be dismantled
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 39ft (12m) sculptural pavilion in the
OL,7,Fstyle of a three-tiered wedding cake
OL,8,Fcould be dismantled next year after it
OL,9,Fwas closed to the public.
OL,11,FBuckinghamshire Council said the
OL,12,FWedding Cake, created by sculptor Joana
OL,13,FVasconcelos, which is on display at
OL,14,FWaddesdon Manor, near Aylesbury, had to
OL,15,Fbe removed by 2036.
OL,17,FWaddesdon Manor said it had not been
OL,18,Fable to keep the Wedding Cake "open for
OL,19,Fquite as long as hoped" after faults in
OL,20,Fits ceramic tiles raised health and
OL,21,Fsafety concerns.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
