OL,3,GNEWSAWedding cake sculptural pavilion
OL,4,Ato be dismantled
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We are hoping to continue to showcase
OL,7,Fart in the landscape, including plans
OL,8,Ffor a new contemporary sculpture trail
OL,9,Fin the grounds of Waddesdon Manor,
OL,10,Fwhich will open in July 2027," a
OL,11,Fspokesperson added.
